cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If a result from this repository is useful, please cite the original
  problem's source first (every problem's status.yaml has a source_url and
  every problem README links the canonical statement). To reference material
  from this repository itself, cite the specific problem directory pinned to
  a commit hash, since statuses change as verification progresses.
title: "Agentic Conjectures"
type: software
authors:
